p2&_nc_oc=AdrEzFOW5MrIC_FID3y_tkK6UqwSUTQpW4ojQkF0BKT1YdTu6JxzLGTBeBGGolZqYoA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCgG9qdL4z7vJBWPu9l9clgsUSO8GgPZJkZvKWE_QSHQQ&oe=6A5798FE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/RTeFWd", "id": "276552923350738", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031433_276552926684071_5398554272214286336_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kERDIzm4wDEQ7kNvwHwrJdK&_nc_oc=AdrdwEh22rrG0J2lgejjbZRKqmHFKPnvTJKVMTJYx4RitaYAjQT3dCdHZoYTZVOPhmI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDgCBgSBiJr39Q8GwkdkaYEEEmKRcTvgHdS5NnwG2-zpg&oe=6A577449"}, "display_name": "Winery Tour in Georgia", "keywords": ["Wine", "Travel", "WineryTour", "Food", "History"], "long_description": "Georgian winemaking method is a part of UNESCO Intangible Heritage. It is the longest uninterrupted tradition of creating wine in the world. Georgia is also one of the oldest winegrowing countries - the pips of the grapes that have been found at Shulaveri Gora historical site are witnessing the fact that the locals were cultivating vines here around 8000 years ago.\nHow does a winery visit look like, once you're in Georgia? Of course, it's a bit of history, a bit of technology, and of course, some excellent food, drinks, songs, and toasts. Take a tour in Giuaani Winery in Manavi (Kakheti), discover more about the Georgian wine, and attend the friendly Georgian supra with the international visitors afterward!\nOf course, this is a demo version that gives you an idea about a half a day winery tour - it takes only one hour to get there from Tbilisi. But a deeper immersion will take you a bit longer. More wineries, more tastings, more exciting landscapes... Georgia is very diverse!", "short_description": "Visit Giuaani Winery in Kakheti with Trails and Wines, and learn more about the Georgian wine and winemaking peculiarities"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_pr